cb21', 'd82b2260c81ae5f8', '2cdc3c987ed9b009', 'c0d726616ec287d4'], 'raw_excerpts': [{'signal_id': 'ab06c2b99631c0f5', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Deception in Mass Autonomous Warfare <p>&#8220;[T]he exigencies of desperate survival do stimulate wise leaders to seek such unorthodox solutions.&#8221; &#8212;Barton Whaley, StratagemOn the night of Jan. 5, 2025, my first mission in the Pokrovsk command post was to make a fake ', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/deception-in-mass-autonomous-warfare/'}, {'signal_id': '79fd340aed19f8df', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Brothers in Arms, Partners in Healing: A Story about a Breakthrough in Treating Post-Traumatic Stress <p>After losing fellow marines in Iraq, Jeff Lindquist struggled with post-traumatic stress that was steadily destroying his life. Years later, an innovative technology helped hi', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/brothers-in-arms-partners-in-healing-a-story-about-a-breakthrough-in-treating-post-traumatic-stress/'}, {'signal_id': 'd1bf67c0447f1ea5', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'The Endless Chip War <p>This exclusive Cogs of War interview is with Rakesh Kumar, the author of Chip Age: How Semiconductors Became the World&#8217;s Most Powerful Resource. Rakesh has worked as a co-founder, professor, researcher, and advisor in the chip industry for more than ', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/cogs-of-war/the-endless-chip-war/'}, {'signal_id': 'e50c8cf946b256c0', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'The West Is Thinking Too Small About Ukraine’s Victory <p>Since fall 2023, Ukraine&#8217;s supporters have fallen into a pattern: Ukrainians warn that Russia is targeting its energy infrastructure to prevent them from heating their homes, schools, and businesses in the coming win', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/the-west-is-thinking-too-small-about-ukraines-victory/'}, {'signal_id': '504789077c3e2db9', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Fighting in Ethiopia and the Risk of Regional Spillover <p>In September, fighting broke out in Ethiopia&#8217;s Tigray region between Ethiopian government forces and the Tigray People&#8217;s Liberation Front (TPLF), effectively collapsing the 2022 peace deal. In October, Ethiopi', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/fighting-in-ethiopia-and-the-risk-of-regional-spillover/'}, {'signal_id': '96067be01a3925c0', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Establishing Battery Supply Chain Resilience for Drones <p>Militaries have spent more than a century operating with fuel and ammunition as limits of combat endurance. They are only beginning to treat batteries with the same operational seriousness, as small unmanned systems move ', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/cogs-of-war/establishing-battery-supply-chain-resilience-for-drones/'}, {'signal_id': '46c8ac1798543095', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Tehran is a Different Beast Now <p>The Tehran that the world knew is gone. It died in the fires with former Supreme Leader Ali Khamenei on the first day of the war in February. His son and new Supreme Leader, Mojtaba Khamenei &#8212; wherever he is and in whatever physical condit', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/tehran-is-a-different-beast-now/'}, {'signal_id': '20959e0f322e0b35', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Reading Pyongyang Through the Cracks of the International System <p>In 2023, three North Korea analysts identified what they believe most people studying the country get wrong, and how analysts can avoid those traps. Three years later, we asked them to revisit their arguments and', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/reading-pyongyang-through-the-cracks-of-the-international-system/'}, {'signal_id': '6b33ec26d149c8cf', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Guns, Growth, and the German Reinvention of Military Keynesianism <p>In March 2025, Germany did more than loosen a fiscal rule. It fused two national emergencies &#8212; a deteriorating European security order and a deteriorating industrial model &#8212; into a single constitutio', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/guns-growth-and-the-german-reinvention-of-military-keynesianism/'}, {'signal_id': '42dd74dd00ec1072', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'In Skepticism We Trust: Ukraine Reacts to the Diesel Deal <p>Welcome to The Ukraine Compass, a weekly digest of Ukrainian commentary and analysis from across the political spectrum only for War on the Rocks members. Each week, we bring you a curated selection of articles from Ukr', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/in-skepticism-we-trust-ukraine-reacts-to-the-diesel-deal/'}, {'signal_id': 'f38841d29de98b9b', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'The Pentagon Doesn’t Need to Reinvent Supply Chain Transparency <p>As the United States seeks to rebuild its defense industrial base, Washington is scrambling to understand an industrial ecosystem that it no longer controls, nor largely understands. China has been able to achieve', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/cogs-of-war/the-pentagon-doesnt-need-to-reinvent-supply-chain-transparency/'}, {'signal_id': 'e17b18b4e6f080a9', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'March Separately, Strike Combined: Rethinking Mass and Maneuver on the Transparent Battlefield <p>Between May 10 and 13, 1940, German Panzer Group Kleist advanced through the densely wooded Ardennes Forest, which the French considered impenetrable to large, mechanized formations.', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/march-separately-strike-combined-rethinking-mass-and-maneuver-on-the-transparent-battlefield/'}, {'signal_id': '3df0b9933c5c95ea', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'China’s Strategic Reassessment of India <p>As China and India have improved their relations in recent months, many observers have attributed this improvement to the end of U.S. strategic altruism toward India. Indeed, in the past year, China has watched India lose its balance and', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/chinas-strategic-reassessment-of-india/'}, {'signal_id': '617aa970b2e89f29', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Do the Benefits Outweigh the Risks of Hosting U.S. Military Bases? <p>Since the end of World War II, the United States has maintained hundreds of military installations abroad. While U.S. forces have faced some objections to their presence, many allies and partners have seen U.S.', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/do-the-benefits-outweigh-the-risks-of-hosting-u-s-military-bases/'}, {'signal_id': 'd5b6daf0837c1f71', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Golden Dome Is Technologically and Financially Infeasible <p>For as long as nuclear-armed, intercontinental ballistic missiles and submarine-launched ballistic missiles have existed, strategists and engineers have pursued a seductive idea: a shield effective enough to diminish &#', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/cogs-of-war/golden-dome-is-technologically-and-financially-infeasible/'}, {'signal_id': '385dbb7b1febdab2', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'How Sudan Became a Laboratory for Drone Warfare, Thanks to Abu Dhabi <p>In June 2026, I visited Khartoum, my hometown, for the first time since the war broke out in Sudan in April 2023. I left the city to seek safety with my family after the war spread into civilian neighborhoods', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/how-sudan-became-a-laboratory-for-drone-warfare-thanks-to-abu-dhabi/'}, {'signal_id': 'be056ebaa30940a5', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'China’s Military Expansion in Southeast Asia Masks a More Complicated Reality <p>The Chinese Ministry of Defense&#8217;s announcement of a &#8220;joint support and training center&#8221; at an airport in Ban Keun, Laos, on Sept. 29 drew attention to the People&#8217;s Liberation ', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/chinas-military-expansion-in-southeast-asia-masks-a-more-complicated-reality/'}, {'signal_id': 'c0b56a464ff0f