trial base problem. Whether it&#8217;s a hypothetical Taiwan invasion wargame run two dozen times, the current Iranian conflict, or the Russo-Ukrainian War, the same result repeats: Magazines o', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/cogs-of-war/building-an-arsenal-that-survives-the-tenth-salvo/'}, {'signal_id': 'de027184fb55a1b7', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'How Taiwan Activates Beijing’s Chosen Fear <p>The standard explanations for why Taiwan is so important to the Chinese Communist Party are familiar: territorial integrity, credibility of deterrence commitments, great power competition with the United States, the strategic value of', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/how-taiwan-activates-beijings-chosen-fear/'}, {'signal_id': '349c62e476be9673', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Ground Robots Are Arriving on the Front Lines <p>For years, ground autonomy lagged well behind its counterparts in the air. That gap is starting to close. Jonathan is joined by Ryan Hartman (Ondas Sentinel) and Scott Philips (Forterra) to examine what it takes to field autonomous', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/cogs-of-war/ground-robots-are-arriving-on-the-front-lines/'}, {'signal_id': '97d6bef2c944be24', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'How China and America Can Move from Competition to Stability <p>The American team thought it was signaling restraint. The Chinese team saw preparations for combat. In a closed-door Sino-American crisis simulation I helped organize in the 2010s &#8212; which the U.S. military fund', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/how-china-and-america-can-move-from-competition-to-stability/'}, {'signal_id': '2142be6d8782effc', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Shows of Strength and Signs of Strain <p>Welcome to The Adversarial.&#160;Every other week, we&#8217;ll provide you with expert analysis on America&#8217;s greatest challengers: China, Russia, Iran, North Korea, and jihadists. Read more below.***IranIn late September, U.S. and Ir', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/shows-of-strength-and-signs-of-strain/'}, {'signal_id': 'fe074f4791904e96', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'The Last Mile of Pentagon Reform Runs Through the Brigade <p>A kill chain measured in seconds cannot depend on processes measured in weeks or months. The Pentagon recognizes that drone proliferation and AI-enabled lethal targeting are reducing decision cycles and increasing the p', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/cogs-of-war/the-last-mile-of-pentagon-reform-runs-through-the-brigade/'}, {'signal_id': '9e96443e4397e990', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Fornication in America: Trump’s Arch, Rome’s Emperors, and the Meaning of Victory <p>In 79 A.D., Gaius Plinius Secundus, known today as Pliny the Elder, was the supreme commander of the Roman imperial fleet, permanently stationed at Misenum near Naples. He died during the eruptio', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/fornication-in-america-trumps-arch-romes-emperors-and-the-meaning-of-victory/'}, {'signal_id': '37973df28de692e9', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Ten Wartime Technologies at America’s 250th <p>For America&#8217;s 250th anniversary, Cogs of War ran ten essays on innovations forged in wartime that subsequently diffused throughout the civilian economy, or had a lasting impact on society, governance, and Americans&#8217; relat', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/cogs-of-war/ten-wartime-technologies-at-americas-250th/'}, {'signal_id': '95001aa2838eec83', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Achieving Breakthrough: Maneuver Warfare in the Face of Robotic Mass <p>In 1914, European armies entered a war with forces designed to move. Within months, they were digging themselves into the earth. Fires from newly introduced machine guns and heavy artillery made movement acro', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/achieving-breakthrough-maneuver-warfare-in-the-face-of-robotic-mass/'}, {'signal_id': '3312