mander Transformation, Adm. Pierre Vandier, returns to the studio to discuss how the alliance is continuously adapting to a new era of warfare driven by software, data, and uncrewed systems, a', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/cogs-of-war/collective-defense-in-an-era-of-tokens-and-data-links/'}, {'signal_id': 'd1016e746dc68955', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Speed to Fielding Is Not Speed to Combat Power <p>I spent more than 20 years in U.S. Army air defense, much of it in cramped control stations where the difference between a successful engagement and a catastrophic loss came down to the soldier at the console. The radar did its jo', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/speed-to-fielding-is-not-speed-to-combat-power/'}, {'signal_id': 'ec28565eed6fe31f', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Tracing the Future Soldier’s Tech Stack <p>Movies, shows, and books have long been at the forefront of imagining the future of war. If you were to picture the &#8220;future soldier,&#8221; you&#8217;d likely picture the genetically engineered super soldiers that have captivated &', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/cogs-of-war/tracing-the-future-soldiers-tech-stack/'}, {'signal_id': '21c9c6c673f0bf7e', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'North Korea’s Irregular Warfare After Ukraine <p>Pyongyang has a long history of conducting irregular warfare and asymmetric operations: Look no further than the 1968 Blue House raid or the 1996 submarine incursion as the most pressing examples. More often than not, North Korea f', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/north-koreas-irregular-warfare-after-ukraine/'}, {'signal_id': '259ceb6b0e5126a0', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Power, Prudence, and Restraint in Fénelon’s Telemachus <p>&#8220;If one is to judge by the fire and ardor with which this book is sought after, it is the most excellent of all books. Never were so many copies printed of any work; never were so many editions made of a single book;', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/power-prudence-and-restraint-in-fenelons-telemachus/'}, {'signal_id': 'b098b39f0b67ad91', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'The New Signature Wounds: How Drone Warfare Is Reshaping the Injuries Veterans Bring Home <p>Traumatic brain injury became the signature wound of the post-9/11 wars because the battlefield changed. Improvised explosive devices changed the nature of American combat injuries. But t', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/the-new-signature-wounds-how-drone-warfare-is-reshaping-the-injuries-veterans-bring-home/'}, {'signal_id': '7e23b592960eb8bd', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'South Korea’s Deliberate Strategic Ambiguity on Taiwan <p>In 2021, Sungmin Cho wrote, &#8220;South Korea&#8217;s Taiwan Conundrum,&#8221; where he argued Seoul&#8217;s complex strategic position makes engagement on questions of involvement over a Taiwan contingency complicated. F', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/south-koreas-deliberate-strategic-ambiguity-on-taiwan/'}, {'signal_id': '1e3f2d5ffb0f815c', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Winning by the Rules: Optimizing Weapons Reviews in the Age of Technological Innovation <p>We spare the reader another detailed story from Ukraine to establish the now-familiar point that battlefield technology changes faster than militaries can acquire, review, and field it. The', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/cogs-of-war/winning-by-the-rules-optimizing-weapons-reviews-in-the-age-of-technological-innovation/'}, {'signal_id': '6b1638584d278fe5', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Seoul Needs a Playbook for Hormuz, Ukraine, and What Comes Next <p>Earlier this month, President Donald Trump shared a Washington Post opinion piece on his social media, arguing that South Korea should send its Cheongung-II air-defense system to Ukraine. Additionally, the Trump a', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/seoul-needs-a-playbook-for-hormuz-ukraine-and-what-comes-next/'}, {'signal_id': '9bf925df61fedba8', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'What the End of Operation Inherent Resolve Means for Iraq and Syria <p>Operation Inherent Resolve is scheduled to end on Sept. 30, as remaining U.S. troops in northern Iraq complete their withdrawal. The United States formed Combined Joint Task Force &#8211; Operation Inherent Re', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/what-the-end-of-operation-inherent-resolve-means-for-iraq-and-syria/'}, {'signal_id': 'aadf64d78d30213a', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Missed the Marque: Cyber Privateers Wanted, Compensation to Be Determined <p>Coverage of the new White House memorandum on combating cybercrime quickly reached the privateer label. CNN called the participants &#8220;cyber privateers,&#8221; invoking the image of government-sancti', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/missed-the-marque-cyber-privateers-wanted-compensation-to-be-determined/'}, {'signal_id': '42225fa90d1fc0ae', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Zelensky’s Perception Problem: Are New Partnerships a Solution? <p>Welcome to&#160;The Ukraine Compass, a weekly digest of Ukrainian commentary and analysis from across the political spectrum, only for War on the Rocks&#160;members. Each Monday, we bring you a curated selection o', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/zelenskys-perception-problem-are-new-partnerships-a-solution/'}, {'signal_id': 'd44ca2407cb37de2', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Washington’s Foreign Equity Bets Need Better Governance <p>What do a rare earth mine in Brazil and a graphite mine in Mozambique have in common? Both have received significant United States government funding. The rub? Neither was subject, when the financing was committed, to the', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/cogs-of-war/washingtons-foreign-equity-bets-need-better-governance/'}, {'signal_id': '6cd84c792977536e', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Only America Could Have Designed the Field Jacket <p>When the M-1943 field jacket was introduced at the height of World War II, it was a revolutionary garment. The jacket was the result of rigorous testing, input from an astonishingly diverse group of experts, and was produced by', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/only-america-could-have-designed-the-field-jacket/'}, {'signal_id': '6fa782126a98f2f9', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Pressure Points <p>Welcome to The Adversarial.&#160;Every other week, we&#8217;ll provide you with expert analysis on America&#8217;s greatest challengers: China, Russia, Iran, North Korea, and jihadists. Read more below.***IranSenior officials from Iran, Oman, and neighboring Gu', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/pressure-points/'}, {'signal_id': 'b35af368cba43d4e', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Why Eurasia, Not the Indo-Pacific, Matters Most in Next Phase of Taiwan Deterrence <p>Washington is preparing for the right war, but in the wrong theater. For years, U.S. strategic thinking has centered on the Indo&#8209;Pacific: the militarized atolls of the South China Sea, Chi', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/why-eurasia-not-the-indo-pacific-matters-most-in-next-phase-of-taiwan-deterrence/'}, {'signal_id': '0dfdfc89ad8a5bd8', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Latin America’s Balancing Act: Washington, Beijing, and the Post-Maduro Environment <p>The year 2026 has brought sweeping change to Latin America&#8217;s relationship with the United States. Following a major military buildup in the Caribbean and strikes against vessels suspected', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/latin-americas-balancing-act-washington-beijing-and-the-post-maduro-environment/'}, {'signal_id': '8944db22e6d28bad', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'A Body Blow? The War on Iran and U.S. Military Readiness <p>The war against Iran is putting new strains on U.S. military readiness by consuming munitions and missile defense interceptors, as well as through extended deployments, sustained operational demands, and the diversion of', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/a-body-blow-the-war-on-iran-and-u-s-military-readiness/'}, {'signal_id': 'cbccfe7292bfa507', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'An Army General Talks Fusing Sensors and Shooters on the Eastern Flank <p>This exclusive Cogs of War interview is with Brig. Gen. Steven P. Carpenter, the commanding general of Multi-Domain Command &#8211; Europe, the U.S. Army&#8217;s first multi-domain operations command, headq', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/cogs-of-war/an-army-general-talks-fusing-sensors-and-shooters-on-the-eastern-flank/'}, {'signal_id': '14613f43f63d6d48', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'The Real U.S.-Saudi Nuclear Deal Is Better Than We Thought <p>On Aug. 24, 2026, the Trump administration transmitted the text of the U.S.-Saudi nuclear cooperation agreement to Congress. By doing so, the administration triggered the 90-day congressional review process described i', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/the-real-u-s-saudi-nuclear-deal-is-better-than-we-thought/'}, {'signal_id': '1b6780d40e17f368', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Would NATO Membership for Ukraine Undermine Article 5 Itself? <p>In 2025, Jennifer Kavanaugh and Christopher McCallion wrote, &#8220;Armed Neutrality for Ukraine Is NATO&#8217;s Least Poor Option,&#8221; where they made the case for armed neutrality over full NATO membership as t', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/would-nato-membership-for-ukraine-undermine-article-5-itself/'}, {'signal_id': 'ba38c72ae33bc53d', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Strategic Stability and the Rebuilding of Xi’s Military <p>For all the warnings about an increasingly capable Chinese military, this may very well be an awkward moment for Beijing to have that military tested. General Secretary Xi Jinping has hollowed out much of the People&#8217', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/strategic-stability-and-the-rebuilding-of-xis-military/'}, {'signal_id': '0e3e84200aea153a', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Three Patrons, Three Clients: The Mecca Alliance No One Owns <p>Every alliance contains a struggle over who gets to decide what the alliance is for. The unusual thing about the Mecca Alliance, formally known as the &#8220;Mecca Joint Defence Agreement,&#8221; is that all three of', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/three-patrons-three-clients-the-mecca-alliance-no-one-owns/'}, {'signal_id': '60d56685c2a1dbaa', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Reading the Kremlin’s Mind: Ukrainian Writers Attempt to Understand Putin <p>Welcome to&#160;The Ukraine Compass, a weekly digest of Ukrainian commentary and analysis from across the political spectrum, only for War on the Rocks&#160;members. Each Monday, we bring you a curated s', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/reading-the-kremlins-mind-ukrainian-writers-attempt-to-understand-putin/'}, {'signal_id': '5321bc66169b0448', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'This Is Not Your Father’s Nuclear Flight Test Vehicle <p>For decades, the United States&#8217; nuclear weapons enterprise has wrestled with an institutional paradox. On one hand is the imperative to make the complex more &#8220;responsive&#8221; to global tumult and technical sur', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/cogs-of-war/this-is-not-your-fathers-nuclear-flight-test-vehicle/'}, {'signal_id': '144f18951d48a536', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'The Big Bet on the Emerging Space Economy <p>The space economy has surpassed $600 billion in annual value, with some projecting it will reach a trillion by the 2030s. Jonathan Panter is joined by Joseph Yaffe (Cowboy Space), Brian Weeden (The Aerospace Corporation), and Dan Wald ', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/cogs-of-war/the-big-bet-on-the-emerging-space-economy/'}, {'signal_id': '572beec097ba7921', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'The Age of Strategic Exclusion <p>Major powers are increasingly trying to shut out their rivals. Russia invaded Ukraine in part to prevent the latter&#8217;s further integration with the West. The United States is restricting China&#8217;s access to advanced semiconductors and en', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/the-age-of-strategic-exclusion/'}, {'signal_id': 'f0fc561dabb21987', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'The War’s Last Generation Is Still Holding America’s Moral Debt <p>On the first night of the evacuation of Kabul, Aug. 15, 2021, a young mother found me in the crowd at Hamid Karzai International Airport. She had marked me, correctly, as someone who spoke her language. By the end', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/the-wars-last-generation-is-still-holding-americas-moral-debt/'}, {'signal_id': '4b88f91f1e94cc8a', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'What America’s Adversaries and Allies Hope to Gain at the U.N. General Assembly <p>This year&#8217;s U.N. General Assembly officially opened on Tuesday, Sept. 8. The annual gathering gives diplomats and leaders a valuable opportunity to press their foreign policy priorities and e', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/what-americas-adversaries-and-allies-hope-to-gain-at-the-u-n-general-assembly/'}, {'signal_id': 'a7390c5588471bb5', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Automating the Action Officer: Between Bureaucracy and Technology <p>If there is a revolution brewing in the automation of white-collar work, you wouldn&#8217;t know it at the Pentagon. Here, the typical action officers, staff who tackle the daily work of the bureaucracy, perform', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/cogs-of-war/automating-the-action-officer-between-bureaucracy-and-technology/'}, {'signal_id': '0b26e2a94a596635', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'The Assessment Gap in U.S. Counter-Terrorism Strikes <p>For eight years I helped decide whether American counter-terrorism money was working.As a programs advisor in the State Department&#8217;s Bureau of Counterterrorism from 2018 to 2025, I oversaw about 20 projects in East Afr', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/the-assessment-gap-in-u-s-counter-terrorism-strikes/'}, {'signal_id': '2d8abdb2b2846625', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Forced Into the Right Decision? A Look at U.S. Land-Based Deterrence Posture <p>In 2019, Steve Fetter wrote &#8220;A Cheaper Nuclear Sponge,&#8221; in which he argued that building a new intercontinental ballistic missile (ICBM) was unnecessary for strengthening U.S. land-based d', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/forced-into-the-right-decision-a-look-at-u-s-land-based-deterrence-posture/'}, {'signal_id': 'cd0808c402ea03a0', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'The Tyranny of Shipyard Cost-Plus Contracting <p>As a naval shipyard commander, my mandate from Navy leadership is straightforward:&#160;return warships to the fleet as quickly as possible.&#160;Neither my shipyard nor many other public and private shipyards are consistently fulf', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/cogs-of-war/the-tyranny-of-shipyard-cost-plus-contracting/'}, {'signal_id': '1fa4ef77cf82cdeb', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'The Strange Transformation of the Front Line in Ukraine <p>On Jan. 5, 2025, my volunteer platoon attached to the 23rd Special Purpose Battalion of the Presidential Brigade entered a 1-kilometer-long tree line called CHAI, on the outskirts of Kotlyne, a few kilometers west of Pokr', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/the-strange-transformation-of-the-front-line-in-ukraine/'}, {'signal_id': '1670eaafeaf89241', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'The Mecca Pact’s Credibility Gap <p>Collective-defense pacts are meant to make war less likely. Poorly designed ones can do the opposite. If allies make sweeping promises without the military integration, decision-making mechanisms, and escalation controls needed to carry them ou', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/the-mecca-pacts-credibility-gap/'}, {'signal_id': '179f7c3bf766d1d7', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'The Two Questions Ukraine Asks Before Every Decision <p>Welcome to&#160;The Ukraine Compass, a weekly digest of Ukrainian commentary and analysis from across the political spectrum, only for War on the Rocks&#160;members. Each Monday, we bring you a curated selection of articles ', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/the-two-questions-ukraine-asks-before-every-decision/'}, {'signal_id': '36101dbfb0e6fd00', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'China’s Warrior Scientists: Insights from Recent Operations Around Taiwan <p>China&#8217;s marine scientific research ships are expanding their operations around Taiwan, and they are not just there to advance the frontiers of human knowledge. Their operations serve to undermine T', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/chinas-warrior-scientists-insights-from-recent-operations-around-taiwan/'}, {'signal_id': '2e5e92fa8759b5b8', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Nicaragua’s Army Will Decide What Comes After Ortega <p>The first institution Nicaragua&#8217;s National Assembly called to testify on the constitutional reform ending competitive elections was the army. On July 29, 2026, Gen. Julio C&#233;sar Avil&#233;s appeared before the Spec', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/nicaraguas-army-will-decide-what-comes-after-ortega/'}, {'signal_id': 'fcd37ab58af255ca', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'The Strategic Fiber of America: Kevlar’s Impact on Warfighters <p>Editor&#8217;s note: This is the tenth and final article in a limited series celebrating American defense technologies born from wartime and their effects on broader national security, politics, and society. This s', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/cogs-of-war/the-strategic-fiber-of-america-kevlars-impact-on-warfighters/'}, {'signal_id': '39d9e910a88dec20', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Shrinking Buffers: Why Turkey and Israel Are on a Collision Course <p>When Israeli warplanes struck the Abu al-Duhur airbase in Syria on Aug. 18, 2026, the smoke rose over the demolition of an old geopolitical assumption about the Middle East. This time, Israel directly targeted ', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/shrinking-buffers-why-turkey-and-israel-are-on-a-collision-course/'}, {'signal_id': 'ebe303df75565bf3', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'New Complications in Countering the Flow of Arms in the Caribbean <p>Arms trafficking in the Caribbean has soared in recent years, with many states now ranking firearms trafficking as the number one public safety and security threat. As new methods of arming individuals and gangs', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/new-complications-in-countering-the-flow-of-arms-in-the-caribbean/'}, {'signal_id': '562cfd567c178dd5', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'The Fruit of Patience: How Regional Shifts Ripened Turkey’s Path to Kurdish Reconciliation <p>On Aug. 25, at the People&#8217;s Palace in Damascus, Mazloum Abdi announced the dissolution of the Syrian Democratic Forces, which he had commanded for a decade. Speaking first in Arabi', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/the-fruit-of-patience-how-regional-shifts-ripened-turkeys-path-to-kurdish-reconciliation/'}, {'signal_id': 'c5fd9481f083a76c', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'The Future of Combat Medicine <p>War has always been a brutal engine of medical innovation, running on a feedback loop: Civilian breakthroughs are adapted for the battlefield, while battlefield necessity pushes advances back into civilian care. We asked three experts to identify ', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/the-future-of-combat-medicine/'}, {'signal_id': 'e5f45c9d96afca7a', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Where Does AI Escalation Come From? We Don’t Know. We Should Find Out. <p>We played a wargame using AI players. Two nuclear-armed nations &#8212; Red and Blue &#8212; with a long-standing, fierce border dispute were placed into a militarized crisis. Over the course of several tur', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/where-does-ai-escalation-come-from-we-dont-know-we-should-find-out/'}, {'signal_id': 'ab358b5b30e1439a', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Russia’s Road to El Dorado <p>As a new convoy of Russian armored vehicles arrives from the port of Lom&#233; to support Russia&#8217;s Africa Corps deployment in Mali, that mission has entered its fifth year. Russia&#8217;s investment of blood and treasure urgently demands a retu', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/russias-road-to-el-dorado/'}, {'signal_id': '7fbe8eccdeb08001', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Is Taiwanese Society Prepared for a China Contingency? <p>In 2025, Michael Hunzeker and Yuster Yu wrote, &#8220;Taiwan&#8217;s Biggest Problem in Steeling Itself for War With China is Cultural,&#8221; where they argued major cultural changes were needed in both Taiwan&#8217;s mil', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/is-taiwanese-society-prepared-for-a-china-contingency/'}, {'signal_id': '079b19806a85db24', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'European Resilience in Digital Infrastructure: The Changing Nature of State-Business Relations <p>As the war in Ukraine progressed, Russian strikes increasingly degraded Ukraine&#8217;s terrestrial communications infrastructure, steadily deepening Kyiv&#8217;s dependence on Space', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/cogs-of-war/european-resilience-in-digital-infrastructure-the-changing-nature-of-state-business-relations/'}, {'signal_id': '735d938f937d5f34', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Ukraine’s Ground Robots and the Economics of Survival <p>In August 2024, special forces from five Ukrainian military intelligence units crossed the Black Sea to raid Russian-held Kinburn Spit. The commandos of these units &#8212; Chimera, Aratta, Stuhna, Paragon, Terror, and the ', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/ukraines-ground-robots-and-the-economics-of-survival/'}, {'signal_id': 'd334c7e095244b24', 'source': 'war_on_the_rocks', 'text_snippet': 'Why Are People Talking About a German Reset with Russia? <p>The summer of 2026 has raised questions once again among politicians, diplomats, and academics about whether Germany might be about to dither on Russia. Last month, a drone attack on German soil seemed designed to coerce', 'url': 'https://warontherocks.com/why-are-people-talking-about-a-german-reset-with-russia/'}, {'signal_id': 'fcc142ead8a66abb', 'source': 'cipher_brief', 'text_snippet': 'Turkey Has Outsourced Its Censorship to American Companies <p>Earlier this month, Sky News correspondent <a href="https://ground.news/article/sky-news-reporter-alex-crawfords-x-account" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Alex Crawford</a> got a notice from X: her account w', 'url': 'https://www.thecipherbrief.com/turkey-has-outsourced-its-censorship-to-american-companies'}, {'signal_id': 'e1b2c0d145ded66c', 'source': 'cipher_brief', 'text_snippet': 'Technology Is Outrunning the Way We Fight <p>The United States is racing to field AI and autonomous systems. It is not racing to figure out how to fight with them. This imbalance between technology and concepts is widening a gap the U.S. is ill prepared to close. Ukraine has show', 'url': 'https://www.thecipherbrief.com/technology-is-outrunning-the-way-we-fight'}, {'signal_id': '15b847110bac0873', 'source': 'cipher_brief', 'text_snippet': 'Hybrid Threats: Why Awareness Must Transcend Individual Cyberattacks <p>Every October, Cybersecurity Awareness Month puts practical security measures in the spotlight. Can an employee recognize a phishing email? Will someone pause before clicking a suspicious link? Are passwords ', 'url': 'https://www.thecipherbrief.com/hybrid-threats-why-awareness-must-transcend-individual-cyberattacks'}, {'signal_id': '46024bc6e9fc668a', 'source': 'cipher_brief', 'text_snippet': 'America\'s Counter-Drone Authority Is Real, The Capacity Isn\'t Yet <p>Here is a number worth sitting with: federal teams seized roughly <a href="https://dronexl.co/2026/10/05/fbi-counter-drone-school-double-capacity-woodward" target="_blank" title="https://dronexl.co/2026/10/05/fb', 'url': 'https://www.thecipherbrief.com/america-s-counter-drone-authority-is-real-the-capacity-isn-t-yet'}, {'signal_id': '217c50e76268bc84', 'source': 'cipher_brief', 'text_snippet': "The U.S. Army’s Pacific Strategy Depends on Allies <p>“We never fight alone. We've never done that. You can go all the way back to the days of Revolutionary War. The United States has never gone into conflict on its own. We've always built coalitions. We've always involved partne", 'url': 'https://www.thecipherbrief.com/the-u-s-armys-pacific-strategy-depends-on-allies'}, {'signal_id': '612051baeeba5542', 'source': 'cipher_brief', 'text_snippet': "The Hidden Risks of AI-Powered Intelligence <p><span>Picture an </span>intelligent analyst's screen. Data about troop movements, a port closure, a terrorist attack, or a weapons transfer sits at the center of a clean interface, with a confidence indicator glowing green. Two hundr", 'url': 'https://www.thecipherbrief.com/the-hidden-risks-of-ai-powered-intelligence'}, {'signal_id': '67fbdeb10f8d3e21', 'source': 'cipher_brief', 'text_snippet': 'What a Russian Hybrid Attack Might Look Like <p>Russia has demonstrated a growing willingness to use hybrid tactics – including sabotage, cyberattacks, information operations, and the use of deniable or “throwaway” agents – to create disruption and uncertainty across Europe. This', 'url': 'https://www.thecipherbrief.com/what-a-russian-hybrid-attack-might-look-like'}, {'signal_id': 'aabdf5a0d915c66e', 'source': 'cipher_brief', 'text_snippet': 'Muhammad bin Salman’s Humbling and the Return of the Ottomans <p>The Houthis bloodied Saudi Crown Prince Muhammad bin Salman’s nose—again—with their deadly, cruel, but effective attacks on Riyadh’s King Khalid International Airport last week. The strikes are the latest in a serie', 'url': 'https://www.thecipherbrief.com/muhammad-bin-salmans-humbling-and-the-return-of-the-ottomans'}, {'signal_id': '1768a2a205f8c24a', 'source': 'cipher_brief', 'text_snippet': 'The Day We Cannot Choose <p>Washington made three decisions this week, and none of them has an end date. On the night of October 14, Ukrainian units in the field found that their Starshield terminals had been capped at a speed, 160 kilometers an hour by the published figure, 70 b', 'url': 'https://www.thecipherbrief.com/the-day-we-cannot-choose'}, {'signal_id': '809453e0a348c58b', 'source': 'cipher_brief', 'text_snippet': 'How Far Should the U.S. Go to Defend Saudi Arabia? <img src="https://www.thecipherbrief.com/media-library/saudi-yemen-us-israel-iran-war.jpg?id=68454050&amp;width=1200&amp;height=800&amp;coordinates=0%2C0%2C1%2C0" /><br /><br /><p><em>Recent deadly attacks by Yemen\'s Iranian-back', 'url': 'https://www.thecipherbrief.com/how-far-should-the-u-s-go-to-defend-saudi-arabia'}, {'signal_id': 'b097fb4beb88b6eb', 'source': 'cipher_brief', 'text_snippet': 'Who Really Makes Decisions in Tehran? <p>Ayatollah Ali Khamenei’s death led to greater decentralization of the regime and a more collective, securitized decision-making system. In Iran today, authority is distributed across several actors and groups, in which the military-securit', 'url': 'https://www.thecipherbrief.com/who-really-makes-decisions-in-tehran'}, {'signal_id': 'd5f29eddafe9987c', 'source': 'cipher_brief', 'text_snippet': 'The Soviet Roots of Russia’s Modern Disinformation War <p>Anti-Semitism, the Rev. Dr. Martin Luther King Jr. pronounced while repudiating an anti-Israel resolution adopted at the 1967 National <a href="https://www.jta.org/archive/dr-king-repudiates-anti-semitic-anti-israel-black-', 'url': 'https://www.thecipherbrief.com/the-soviet-roots-of-russias-modern-disinformation-war'}, {'signal_id': 'e217dc903f365fe4', 'source': 'cipher_brief', 'text_snippet': 'Europe’s Changing Politics and the Future of U.S. Leadership <p>“And now, there is war again. There is new competition between great powers. There is vulnerability, aggression, terrorism, a whole universe of new threats and attacks again. And so, we must rebuild our institutions ', 'url': 'https://www.thecipherbrief.com/europes-changing-politics-and-the-future-of-u-s-leadership'}, {'signal_id': 'c5b36c915fd20f4c', 'source': 'cipher_brief', 'text_snippet': 'What Beijing Calls Open, Washington Should Call an Operation <p><em>China is about to run the largest influence operation in history. It will not have to run it. The world will download it.</em><em></em></p><p><strong>EXPERT PERSPECTIVE</strong> -- Our research team at Vanderbilt', 'url': 'https://www.thecipherbrief.com/what-beijing-calls-open-washington-should-call-an-operation-2678089778'}, {'signal_id': '2e00ae1d8820c2c2', 'source': 'cipher_brief', 'text_snippet': 'Washington Cannot Outsource Saudi Security to the Mecca Pact <p>The Houthis have significantly escalated their airstrike campaign targeting civilian infrastructure in Saudi Arabia, with <a href="https://apnews.com/article/saudi-yemen-houthi-riyadh-airport-d2e0868ffb18d883c16465d7', 'url': 'https://www.thecipherbrief.com/washington-cannot-outsource-saudi-security-to-the-mecca-pact'}, {'signal_id': '3f263fbed8d41717', 'source': 'cipher_brief', 'text_snippet': 'The Next War of Attrition is in Yemen <p>Battlefield dynamics in Yemen shift quickly, but Houthi aims do not. A movement organized around radical ideology and perpetual conflict now shares a border with a state organized around modernization and prosperity. Saudi Arabia and the H', 'url': 'https://www.thecipherbrief.com/the-next-war-of-attrition-is-in-yemen'}, {'signal_id': '5fb5d97689873bb8', 'source': 'cipher_brief', 'text_snippet': 'The Pentagon’s Drone Revolution Starts With Soldiers <p><strong><em>Welcome to The Iron Triangle, the Cipher Brief column serving Procurement Officers tasked with buying the future, Investors funding the next generation of defense technology, and the Policy Wonks analyzing its im', 'url': 'https://www.thecipherbrief.com/the-pentagons-drone-revolution-starts-with-soldiers'}, {'signal_id': 'a8bfe1115b4e57c4', 'source': 'cipher_brief', 'text_snippet': 'America’s Military Has a GPS Problem <p>“The Department of Defense’s (DoD) Global Positioning System (GPS) is the principal source of positioning, navigation, and timing (PNT) information for the U.S. military and civilian users. Due to DoD’s reliance on it, GPS also represents a', 'url': 'https://www.thecipherbrief.com/americas-military-has-a-gps-problem'}, {'signal_id': '42be15b3b1569d3d', 'source': 'cipher_brief', 'text_snippet': 'Subterranean Warfare - An Urgent DoW Need Without An Owner <p>The DoW urgently needs to organize its scattered subterranean warfare assets into a single unified organization. Ideally, a Direct Reporting Portfolio Manager (DRPM) for Subterranean Warfare, reporting to the Deputy Se', 'url': 'https://www.thecipherbrief.com/subterranean-warfare-an-urgent-dow-need-without-an-owner'}, {'signal_id': 'f8f75a5bf7797164', 'source': 'cipher_brief', 'text_snippet': 'The Sanctions We Cannot Afford <p>On the evening of Friday, October 9, the Treasury published General License 135. It authorizes the “sale, delivery, offloading and importation” of Russian diesel until April 7, 2027, and does not specify a buyer, a seller, or a quantity. The Pres', 'url': 'https://www.thecipherbrief.com/the-sanctions-we-cannot-afford'}, {'signal_id': '5bdf089f2b16dd6d', 'source': 'cipher_brief', 'text_snippet': 'How Ukraine’s Ground Robots Are Changing the Battlefield <img src="https://www.thecipherbrief.com/media-library/the-214th-separate-assault-battalion-opfor-training-held-in-ukraine.jpg?id=68398449&amp;width=1200&amp;height=800&amp;coordinates=0%2C0%2C0%2C1" /><br /><br /><p><em><e', 'url': 'https://www.thecipherbrief.com/how-ukraines-ground-robots-are-changing-the-battlefield'}, {'signal_id': 'bf9e12e84d1dc0b3', 'source': 'cipher_brief', 'text_snippet': "The Next Drone Won't Have a Radio Link, Our Intelligence Enterprise Needs to Plan for That Now <p>On the last day of the 2026 World Cup, NORAD F-16s fired flares over northern New Jersey to warn off civilian pilots who had flown into restricted airspace. During the tournament, fe", 'url': 'https://www.thecipherbrief.com/the-next-drone-won-t-have-a-radio-link-our-intelligence-enterprise-needs-to-plan-for-that-now'}, {'signal_id': '0bcb1c7ae28afabb', 'source': 'cipher_brief', 'text_snippet': 'The Future of Iran Lies Beyond the Regime <p>The U.S. administration is pursuing its latest strategy: a naval blockade combined with aggressive “Outcast” sanctions, aiming to strangle the Iranian economy, force the regime to its knees, and compel it to return to negotiations on A', 'url': 'https://www.thecipherbrief.com/the-future-of-iran-lies-beyond-the-regime'}, {'signal_id': '36c5f4f6a0f10994', 'source': 'cipher_brief', 'text_snippet': 'How War Starts: A Warning from the Korean DMZ <p>The current landmine incident in the Demilitarized Zone of the Korean Peninsula could escalate into conflict on the Korean Peninsula.</p><p>South Korea and the United Nations Command said North Korea violated the Korean War armisti', 'url': 'https://www.thecipherbrief.com/how-war-starts-a-warning-from-the-korean-dmz'}, {'signal_id': '4d01fc6dc0b91939', 'source': 'cipher_brief', 'text_snippet': 'How America Wins the AI Race With Open Source <p>Speaking in Shanghai on July 17,<a href="https://english.scio.gov.cn/m/topnews/2026-07/18/content_118605932.html" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"> <u>Xi Jinping offered the world a vision of AI “for the positive, for good', 'url': 'https://www.thecipherbrief.com/how-america-wins-the-ai-race-with-open-source'}, {'signal_id': 'a198f323f53a97dc', 'source': 'cipher_brief', 'text_snippet': 'Unique Risks of AI Adoption in Developing Economies <p>The U.S. must set dominance of global AI sector as a <a href="https://www.whitehouse.gov/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Americas-AI-Action-Plan.pdf" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">strategic economic</a> and national se', 'url': 'https://www.thecipherbrief.com/unique-risks-of-ai-adoption-in-developing-economies'}, {'signal_id': 'fd828bc03baa90d7', 'source': 'cipher_brief', 'text_snippet': "Hegseth’s Vision for a New American Military <p>“It's worth saying again so that the fake news understands it. We are no longer the woke department or the weak department. Simple translation of that: No fatties, no trannies, no beardos, no weirdos, no wimps, no radicals, just war", 'url': 'https://www.thecipherbrief.com/hegseths-vision-for-a-new-american-military'}, {'signal_id': '596d796c0889fa82', 'source': 'cipher_brief', 'text_snippet': 'Election Security: Keeping Our Disagreements Our Own <p>About one month before <a href="https://www.fec.gov/help-candidates-and-committees/dates-and-deadlines/2026-reporting-dates/electioneering-communications-periods-general-election-2026/" target="_blank">Election Day</a>, Amer', 'url': 'https://www.thecipherbrief.com/election-security-keeping-our-disagreements-our-own'}, {'signal_id': '3d100916adff2e46', 'source': 'cipher_brief', 'text_snippet': 'The Pentagon’s 2027 Drone Problem <p>On September 30, at Quantico, the Secretary of War announced a four-star command for autonomous warfare. The memorandum behind it is two pages long. It gives two officials 30 days to produce a plan and sets October 1, 2027, as the day the Auto', 'url': 'https://www.thecipherbrief.com/the-pentagons-2027-drone-problem'}, {'signal_id': 'cd18ee2f4feb9892', 'source': 'cipher_brief', 'text_snippet': 'Iran Calls Itself the Victim, Its Record Tells Another Story <p>Iranian President Masoud Pezeshkian’s speech at the United Nations did not mention Iran’s history of terrorism and the thousands of innocent victims killed, or the imprisonment and killing of thousands of its own peo', 'url': 'https://www.thecipherbrief.com/iran-calls-itself-the-victim-its-record-tells-another-story'}, {'signal_id': 'e39b80d4407fc5c2', 'source': 'just_security', 'text_snippet': 'U.N. Emissions Gap Report 2026: “The Point of Return” — Seven Questions to Consider Next <p>The report takes each one-tenth of a degree, and each year above 1.5°C, as meaningful units of change. And with good reason: each means real impacts on humans living in a climate-inflected', 'url': 'https://www.justsecurity.org/161874/unep-emissions-gap-report-seven-questions/?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=unep-emissions-gap-report-seven-questions'}, {'signal_id': '707d2bc34ac13360', 'source': 'just_security', 'text_snippet': 'Early Edition: October 23, 2026 <p>Sign up to receive the Early Edition in your inbox\xa0here. A curated weekday guide to major news and developments over the last 24 hours. Here’s today’s news: RUSSIA-UKRAINE WAR Russian President Vladimir Putin yesterday said that future talks on ', 'url': 'https://www.justsecurity.org/161891/early-edition-october-23-2026/?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=early-edition-october-23-2026'}, {'signal_id': '71251dc4c0815961', 'source': 'just_security', 'text_snippet': 'Litigation Tracker: Legal Challenges to Trump Administration Actions <p>A public resource tracking all the legal challenges to the Trump administration\'s executive orders and actions.</p>\n<p>The post <a href="https://www.justsecurity.org/107087/tracker-litigation-legal-challenges', 'url': 'https://www.justsecurity.org/107087/tracker-litigation-legal-challenges-trump-administration/?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=tracker-litigation-legal-challenges-trump-administration'}, {'signal_id': '1899571d419f0bce', 'source': 'just_security', 'text_snippet': 'How Civil Society Can Help Unlock More Universal and Extraterritorial Jurisdiction Cases <p>By providing national authorities with detailed evidence, civil society can empower national authorities to investigate atrocity crimes.</p>\n<p>The post <a href="https://www.justsecurity.o', 'url': 'https://www.justsecurity.org/161544/civil-society-unlock-universal-extraterritorial-jurisdiction-cases/?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=civil-society-unlock-universal-extraterritorial-jurisdiction-cases'}, {'signal_id': 'c8aeb0daf3cd1393', 'source': 'just_security', 'text_snippet': 'United States Seabed Mineral Activities: Understanding the Legal Landscape <p>Seabed mining is in the news. Distinctions on who, what, where, when, and why this U.S. mining might occur to guide legal governance.</p>\n<p>The post <a href="https://www.justsecurity.org/161136/us-seab', 'url': 'https://www.justsecurity.org/161136/us-seabed-mining-legal-landscape/?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=us-seabed-mining-legal-landscape'}, {'signal_id': '034a0ad1640892ba', 'source': 'just_security', 'text_snippet': 'Frontier AI and Independent Evaluations: Some Inconvenient Questions <p>More needs to be done to create a meaningful, viable, effective, and transparent evaluation system for frontier AI.</p>\n<p>The post <a href="https://www.justsecurity.org/161488/frontier-ai-independent-evaluat', 'url': 'https://www.justsecurity.org/161488/frontier-ai-independent-evaluations-inconvenient-questions/?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=frontier-ai-independent-evaluations-inconvenient-questions'}, {'signal_id': '92c972f9bb4b4426', 'source': 'just_security', 'text_snippet': 'Early Edition: October 22, 2026 <p>Sign up to receive the Early Edition in your inbox\xa0here. A curated weekday guide to major news and developments over the last 24 hours. Here’s today’s news: IRAN WAR Iran’s Islamic Revolutionary Guard Corps Navy today said four vessels involved ', 'url': 'https://www.justsecurity.org/161692/early-edition-october-22-2026/?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=early-edition-october-22-2026'}, {'signal_id': '26e926927b9a1afd', 'source': 'just_security', 'text_snippet': 'Just the Docs: DHS Discloses July Order Stripping DeepSeek AI from Federal Civilian IT Systems <p>DHS publishes July order excluding and removing DeepSeek AI products from federal civilian agency IT systems.</p>\n<p>The post <a href="https://www.justsecurity.org/161614/dhs-deepsee', 'url': 'https://www.justsecurity.org/161614/dhs-deepseek-exclusion-removal-order/?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=dhs-deepseek-exclusion-removal-order'}, {'signal_id': 'dbb19f337cd2ee8f', 'source': 'just_security', 'text_snippet': 'Guantanamo Dispatches: Pentagon Reducing Rank of Top Military Commission Lawyers <p>An order from Secretary Hegseth will lower the ranks of the top two Guantanamo military commission lawyers starting in January.</p>\n<p>The post <a href="https://www.justsecurity.org/160438/pentago', 'url': 'https://www.justsecurity.org/160438/pentagon-reducing-rank-military-commission-lawyers/?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=pentagon-reducing-rank-military-commission-lawyers'}, {'signal_id': '1df31ed92392de27', 'source': 'just_security', 'text_snippet': 'Guantanamo Dispatches: Ahead of Jury Selection, Defense Psychiatrist Calls USS Cole Defendant Unfit for Trial <p>A forensic psychiatrist testified this week that the USS Cole bombing suspect is unfit for trial as a result of his torture by the CIA.</p>\n<p>The post <a href="https:', 'url': 'https://www.justsecurity.org/161589/defense-psychiatrist-uss-cole-defendant-unfit-trial/?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=defense-psychiatrist-uss-cole-defendant-unfit-trial'}, {'signal_id': '1360f15fbaf3d074', 'source': 'rand', 'text_snippet': "Why Quick Compensation Hasn't Replaced Eaton Fire Lawsuits—So Far A review of Southern California Edison's direct-payment program finds that it has paid claimants much faster, but it hasn't become a broad substitute for lawsuits.", 'url': 'https://www.rand.org/pubs/commentary/2026/10/why-quick-compensation-hasnt-replaced-eaton-fire-lawsuits.html'}, {'signal_id': 'b8e2180ad066e052', 'source': 'rand', 'text_snippet': 'The Missing Link in Drug Policy: Why Whole-System Reform Is Stalling The UK has made progress toward a whole-system approach to drug policy, but unclear accountability and persistent stigma are stalling reform.', 'url': 'https://www.rand.org/pubs/commentary/2026/10/the-missing-link-in-drug-policy-why-whole-system-reform.html'}, {'signal_id': '1c27b342495b14b7', 'source': 'rand', 'text_snippet': "A Better Way to Use Criminal Records in Hiring Employers want to know whether an applicant is likely to commit another crime, possibly on the job. But the screening rules many of them use are often about as accurate as a coin toss, in part because they're based on data that don't", 'url': 'https://www.rand.org/pubs/commentary/2026/10/a-better-way-to-use-criminal-records-in-hiring.html'}, {'signal_id': '1f82f8da9de912b0', 'source': 'rand', 'text_snippet': "Biosecurity in the Age of AI: Q&amp;A with Steph Guerra The question that drives Steph Guerra's work at RAND may be one of the most consequential for this moment in the AI era: How can we harness the full potential of AI for science and medicine—but also ensure it never helps any", 'url': 'https://www.rand.org/pubs/commentary/2026/10/biosecurity-in-the-age-of-ai-qa-with-steph-guerra.html'}, {'signal_id': '510596eafa31042f', 'source': 'rand', 'text_snippet': 'From Strategic Logic to Practical Implementation: A Phased Agenda for U.S.-ROK Shipbuilding Cooperation U.S.-ROK cooperation on shipbuilding should be structured so that it strengthens U.S. maritime industrial capacity, makes commercial sense for Korean shipbuilders, and survives', 'url': 'https://www.rand.org/pubs/commentary/2026/10/from-strategic-logic-to-practical-implementation-a.html'}, {'signal_id': 'c5904b48ce512115', 'source': 'rand', 'text_snippet': "9/11's Forgotten Lesson Twenty-five years later, 9/11's lessons are still contested, except the simplest: the United States mistook quiet for peace. And it is doing so again.", 'url': 'https://www.rand.org/pubs/commentary/2026/10/911s-forgotten-lesson.html'}, {'signal_id': '645e5c8159c45b3c', 'source': 'rand', 'text_snippet': 'Schools, Cell Phones, and AI: Q&amp;A with Melissa Kay Diliberti Melissa Kay Diliberti, an associate policy researcher at RAND, discusses recent findings from RAND that can help parents and policymakers better understand what challenges schools are up against.', 'url': 'https://www.rand.org/pubs/commentary/2026/09/schools-cell-phones-and-ai-qa-with-melissa-kay-diliberti.html'}, {'signal_id': 'f0a6bf01926bc40a', 'source': 'rand', 'text_snippet': "Netanyahu May Have Ignored a Dire Warning. Israel Ignores the Deeper Threat. Israel's strategy in Gaza is only keeping Hamas in power: deterred, but not replaced, with no real alternative given a chance. A different outcome calls for a different approach.", 'url': 'https://www.rand.org/pubs/commentary/2026/09/nentanyahu-may-have-ignored-a-dire-warning-israel-ignores-the.html'}, {'signal_id': 'b489a15858be84c1', 'source': 'rand', 'text_snippet': "Never Underestimate the Houthis Yemen's Houthi rebels are in a position to shape the next phase of the conflict between the United States and Iran if they attempt to renew their blockade of the Bab al-Mandab Strait. And no one should assume that a deal with Iran will bind what th", 'url': 'https://www.rand.org/pubs/commentary/2026/09/never-underestimate-the-houthis.html'}, {'signal_id': '19d8064c433770cf', 'source': 'rand', 'text_snippet': "Preserving Jobs and Tax Revenue in the Age of AI: Q&amp;A with Carter Price Carter Price, a mathematician at RAND and co-director of the RAND Von Furstenberg Family Budget Model Initiative, discusses ways to rebalance the tax code so that it doesn't incentivize employers to repla", 'url': 'https://www.rand.org/pubs/commentary/2026/09/preserving-jobs-and-tax-revenue-in-the-age-of-ai-qa.html'}, {'signal_id': 'd2d02311d1d9e0e7', 'source': 'rand', 'text_snippet': 'The Recent Rise of Women Gun Owners In recent years, women made up almost half of all new gun owners, a striking shift from the historical norm, when women accounted for about a quarter of them. And the uptick is widespread across geographic and demographic subgroups.', 'url': 'https://www.rand.org/pubs/commentary/2026/09/the-recent-rise-of-women-gun-owners.html'}, {'signal_id': '2a9dc8988cf7146c', 'source': 'rand', 'text_snippet': "Who Benefits from Education Savings Accounts? Q&amp;A with Susha Roy Tens of thousands of American families use state-funded education savings accounts for their children's education. How exactly do these accounts work? Who benefits from them? And how do they affect education fun", 'url': 'https://www.rand.org/pubs/commentary/2026/09/who-benefits-from-education-savings-accounts.html'}, {'signal_id': '480b7da85115059d', 'source': 'rand', 'text_snippet': "Getting a Security Clearance Doesn't Have to Be So Intimidating: Q&amp;A with Sina Beaghley The security clearance process can be difficult and time-consuming but the government has made big strides in improving it. Sina Beaghley, a senior international and defense researcher at ", 'url': 'https://www.rand.org/pubs/commentary/2026/09/getting-a-security-clearance-doesnt-have-to-be-so-intimidating.html'}, {'signal_id': 'd2b8719ed5ca0a96', 'source': 'rand', 'text_snippet': '25 Years After 9/11: Lessons for Securing the Homeland Reflecting on 25 years since the September 11 terror attacks, RAND experts answer questions about protecting soft targets, the role of the TSA, mitigating risks from emerging technologies, and more.', 'url': 'https://www.rand.org/pubs/commentary/2026/09/25-years-after-911-lessons-for-securing-the-homeland.html'}, {'signal_id': '080553cfaf2bb84f', 'source': 'rand', 'text_snippet': 'AI Can Now Design Viruses. We Need Biosecurity Guardrails Now As AI advances, the risk of engineered viral bioweapons is growing. The window to prepare is now—by building a layered, resilient system of